pothetical counterexample. Its first child constructs a circuit with between 16 and 18 gates and a distinguished earlier control wire. The other two children exclude its AND and OR reconstructions on the 15 edges and 15 maximal independent sets.\n\nI checked the first child in Lean using a 21-leaf monotone formula lower bound and a count of the input and internal wire occurrences. The two residual exclusions remain open. Reinserting the deleted gate and applying a separate checked 17-gate circuit lower bound gives the residual lower limit of 16.\n\nThe pinned Lake target builds locally. I also rechecked the compiled proof body and ran the pinned reduction-shape routine locally. The full local referee was stopped by the server memory guard.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-24T17:54:38Z","updated_at":"2026-11-25T04:49:46Z","closed_at":"2026-11-25T04:49:45Z","merged_at":"2026-11-25T04:49:45Z","merge_commit_sha":"55e8602e4871e9bfb970bee4250aeb1ff6a2b551","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"eyeb0l:petersen-once-read-491","ref":"petersen-once-read-491","repo":{"id":1469253763,"node_id":"R_kgDOV5MIgw","name":"pequalnp-proofs","full_name":"eyeb0l/pequalnp-proofs","owner":{"login":"eyeb0l","id":21983343,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTgzMzQz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21983343?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l","html_url":"https://github.com/eyeb0l","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eyeb0l/repos","events